        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 148321,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jika kita ingin memodifikasi setiap elemen dalam sebuah array dan menyimpan hasilnya dalam array baru, bagaimana cara melakukannya?</p><p>Salah satu cara untuk melakukannya adalah dengan menggunakan loop untuk mengonversi nilai sebelum menyimpannya. Cara ini berhasil, tetapi JavaScript memiliki solusi yang lebih baik.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"array\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"108\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyDamage = [\" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"8\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"14\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"15\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"19\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" reducedDamage = [];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" element \" /><text value=\"of\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyDamage) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" d = \" /><text value=\"Math\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".max(\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", element - \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" reducedDamage.push(d);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(reducedDamage);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>enemyDamage</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 148322,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>JavaScript memiliki fungsi praktis bernama <code>.map()</code>, yang ketika dipanggil pada sebuah array, memungkinkan kita memodifikasi setiap nilai dan menyimpannya dalam array baru.</p><p><code>.map()</code> mengikuti sintaks: <code>arrayName.map()</code>. Mari lihat bagaimana kita dapat memanggilnya pada array <code>enemyDamage</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"reducedDamage\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"86\" /><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"87\" /><option startIndex=\"87\" endIndex=\"88\" /><option startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"89\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyDamage = [\" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"8\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"14\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"15\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"19\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" reducedDamage = enemyDamage.map();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>enemyDamage</code>, diikuti oleh <code>.</code>, lalu <code>map</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 148323,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk memberi tahu <code>.map()</code> cara memodifikasi setiap elemen, kita perlu meneruskan sebuah fungsi sebagai parameter.</p><p>Nanti kita akan memprogram modifikasi kita ke dalam fungsi ini.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"87\" endIndex=\"95\" /><option startIndex=\"95\" endIndex=\"96\" /><option startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"98\" endIndex=\"99\" /><option startIndex=\"99\" endIndex=\"100\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyDamage = [\" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"8\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"14\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"15\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"19\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" reducedDamage = enemyDamage.map(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(reducedDamage);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>function</code>, diikuti oleh <code>(</code>, lalu <code>)</code>, <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 148324,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sebelum kita dapat memodifikasi nilai array, kita perlu meneruskannya ke fungsi. Kita melakukannya dengan menambahkan parameter ke fungsi inline.</p><p>Dalam contoh kita, kita akan menyebut parameternya <code>element</code>, tetapi nama apa pun bisa digunakan.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"86\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" scores = [\" /><text value=\"56\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"27\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"19\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"38\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bonusUnlocked = scores.map(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"element\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (element % \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") == \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(bonusUnlocked);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>element</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 148325,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Menambahkan parameter kedua memungkinkan kita mengakses indeks setiap iterasi bersama dengan nilai array.</p><p>Dalam contoh kita, kita akan menyebut parameternya <code>index</code>, tetapi nama apa pun bisa digunakan.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"113\" endIndex=\"118\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" inventory = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sword&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Shield&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Key&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" displayInventory = inventory.map(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"element, index\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" index + \" /><text value=\"&quot;: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + element;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(displayInventory);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>index</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 148326,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk memberi tahu fungsi <code>.map()</code> nilai apa yang harus disimpan dalam array baru, fungsi inline harus mengembalikan sebuah nilai dengan <code>return</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"108\" endIndex=\"114\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyDamage = [\" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"8\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"14\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"15\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"19\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" reducedDamage = enemyDamage.map(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"element\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Math\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".max(\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", element - \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(reducedDamage);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>return</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 148327,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk menyederhanakan sintaks kita, kita bisa mengganti fungsi inline dengan arrow function JavaScript.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"132\" endIndex=\"139\" /><option startIndex=\"141\" endIndex=\"143\" /><option startIndex=\"144\" endIndex=\"165\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" spriteNames = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;hero_idle&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;slime_walk&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;coin_spin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;door_open&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;boss_roar&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" uppercaseSprites = \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" spriteNames.map(\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"element\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" element.toUpperCase());\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(uppercaseSprites);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>element</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=&gt;</code>, dan terakhir <code>element.toUpperCase()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 148328,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>.map()</code> tidak hanya berfungsi pada array integer, tetapi juga pada tipe nilai lainnya, seperti string.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Array\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"this\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"90\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyNames = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;hannah&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dragon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" nameLength =\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" enemyNames.map(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"element\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" element.length;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(nameLength);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>enemyNames</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 148329,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fungsi JavaScript apa yang dapat kita gunakan untuk memodifikasi setiap elemen dan menyimpan hasilnya dalam array baru?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\"><code>.map()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>.convert()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>.map()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
